{"id":"objeto","lemma":"objeto","pos":"noun","rank":1856,"glosses":["object","objective; goal"],"ipa":"/obˈxeto/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"objetos"},"order":1895,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f4/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-objeto.wav","examples":[{"text":"Vimos un objeto extraño en el cielo.","en":"We saw a strange object in the sky.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/706006","words":[{"g":"to see, to spot","l":"ver"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"strange"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"sky"}]},{"text":"Había varios objetos en el cuarto.","en":"There were various objects in the room.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/599218","words":[{"g":"makes pluperfect to…"},{"g":"various, several"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"fourth"}]},{"text":"Había un objeto en la carretera.","en":"There was something on the road.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/417900","words":[{"g":"makes pluperfect to…"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"road, highway"}]}]}